    "GetReward32531 reads live List<ListArrayInt> Count/index, datas[0]/datas[1], then current Global.PurchaseCost static52, calls ToolChange(id,amount,refreshTop,reason,true), ignores result. GetMultiReward32538 multiplies row amount by multiplier with i32.mul before each dispatch; no validation, merge, rollback or deferred save.",
    "ToolChange32536 enum overload delegates to32533 with notifyAndReport=true.32533 already restored by OutgameToolDispatcher; new control composes that actual implementation, not duplicate reward rules.",
    "GetItemCountById32535 always LocalDataManager.GetToolNum f5913; GetItemNum32543 uses local f11484 below8001, else ItemModuleControl.GetItemNum -> Int64 wrap to Int32. IsEnough32539 compares signed Int32 >= required. Source local aliases use same currency/tool dictionary fields; original global mode remains explicit service boundary.",
